Third-party dependency notes:

NHibernate is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1
(LGPL-2.1). It is consumed as an ordinary, dynamically linked NuGet package
and is not modified or statically embedded. Do not publish any Blinky binary
that references NHibernate with PublishSingleFile, ILMerge, or equivalent
static bundling, as that would change the linking model this arrangement
relies on.

This constrains only Blinky.Api and Blinky.Worker, which run in containers and
are published as ordinary framework-dependent applications. The workstation
agent (Blinky.Agent.Service, Blinky.Agent.Ui) does not reference NHibernate —
it speaks to the API over HTTPS — and may therefore be published single-file
for MSI packaging.

